---
title: Payment state machine - v0 states solid, future states dashed
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> draft

    draft --> validated : schema and business validation
    draft --> rejected : invalid input

    validated --> awaiting_approval : policy require_approval
    validated --> pending : policy allow
    validated --> rejected : policy deny, limit exceeded,<br/>insufficient funds, VoP no_match refused

    awaiting_approval --> pending : step-up verified or human confirms
    awaiting_approval --> rejected : declined or challenge expired

    pending --> settled : ledger posting committed
    pending --> failed : posting error, rollback, no partial write

    settled --> reversed : correcting reversal entry posted

    rejected --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    settled --> [*]
    reversed --> [*]

    note right of pending
        v0 stops here for internal transfers.
        External rails will insert
        submitted and accepted_by_scheme
        between pending and settled
        without changing earlier states.
    end note

    note right of awaiting_approval
        This is where an agent-proposed
        payment waits for human confirmation
        when it falls outside its mandate.
    end note
